  "Description": "AUTOMATIC STAIR GENERATOR: guide line / shaft boundary / Room / Area / CAD -> native Revit stairs (straight, L, U, dog-leg, multi-flight) with automatic landings and railings, floor to floor / all levels / selected levels / continuous, with validation (riser, tread, landing, headroom, floor opening, clashes), update and delete",
  "Name": "B24_MODEL_Automatic_Stair_Generator_Straight_L_U_Dogleg_Multiflight_Landings_All_Levels",
